# Dev tools. requirements-dev.txt is the hashed lock compiled from this file; it includes the app's
# requirements at the versions app/requirements.txt locks, so the tests run against what the image ships.
# Regenerate it after editing here or after app/requirements.txt changes (from the repository root):
#   pip-compile --allow-unsafe --generate-hashes --strip-extras requirements-dev.in
-r app/requirements.in
-c app/requirements.txt
